"Start with essentials, then pack interchangeable layers. Add your charger, toiletries and any medication; check your route and luggage rules before leaving.":row(["Start with essentials, then pack interchangeable layers. Add your charger, toiletries and any medication; check your route and luggage rules before leaving.", "先准备证件和必需品，再带可以混搭的衣物。别忘了充电器、洗漱用品和常用药；出发前检查路线和行李规定。", "先準備證件和必需品，再帶可混搭的衣物。別忘了充電器、盥洗用品和常用藥；出發前檢查路線和行李規定。", "必需品から準備し、着回せる服を選びましょう。充電器、洗面用品、薬も忘れずに。出発前に経路と手荷物の規定を確認してください。", "필수품을 먼저 챙기고 돌려 입을 옷을 고르세요. 충전기, 세면도구, 약도 넣고 출발 전 경로와 수하물 규정을 확인하세요.", "Empieza por lo imprescindible y elige ropa combinable. Añade cargador, aseo y medicación; revisa la ruta y las normas de equipaje.", "Commencez par l’essentiel et des vêtements faciles à associer. Ajoutez chargeur, toilette et médicaments ; vérifiez trajet et bagages.", "Packe zuerst Wichtiges und gut kombinierbare Kleidung ein. Denke an Ladegerät, Pflege und Medikamente; prüfe Route und Gepäckregeln.", "Comece pelo essencial e por roupas que combinam entre si. Inclua carregador, higiene e remédios; confira a rota e as regras de bagagem."]),
"Pack a light waterproof layer, a small umbrella and a dry bag for electronics. Choose shoes that dry quickly and keep a flexible indoor plan. Check the local forecast before you go.":row(["Pack a light waterproof layer, a small umbrella and a dry bag for electronics. Choose shoes that dry quickly and keep a flexible indoor plan. Check the local forecast before you go.", "带一件轻薄防水外套、小伞和电子设备防水袋，选容易晾干的鞋，也准备一个室内备选计划。出发前查看当地天气预报。", "帶輕薄防水外套、小傘和電子設備防水袋，選容易晾乾的鞋，也準備室內備選計畫。出發前查看當地天氣預報。", "薄手の防水上着、折りたたみ傘、機器用の防水袋を用意。乾きやすい靴と屋内の代案も。出発前に現地予報を確認しましょう。", "가벼운 방수 겉옷과 작은 우산, 전자기기 방수 주머니를 챙기세요. 빨리 마르는 신발과 실내 대안도 준비하고 현지 예보를 확인하세요.", "Lleva una capa impermeable ligera, un paraguas y una bolsa seca. Elige calzado de secado rápido y un plan interior; consulta el pronóstico local.", "Prenez une veste imperméable légère, un parapluie et une pochette étanche. Prévoyez des chaussures qui sèchent vite et vérifiez la météo locale.", "Packe eine leichte Regenjacke, einen kleinen Schirm und einen wasserdichten Beutel ein. Plane eine Indoor-Alternative und prüfe die örtliche Vorhersage.", "Leve uma camada impermeável leve, guarda-chuva e bolsa estanque. Prefira calçados de secagem rápida e confira a previsão local."]),
"Capture one small moment each day: where you were, what surprised you and how it felt. Add a photo or a ticket, then leave a note for your next visit.":row(["Capture one small moment each day: where you were, what surprised you and how it felt. Add a photo or a ticket, then leave a note for your next visit.", "每天记下一件小事：你在哪里、什么让你惊喜、当时感觉如何。加一张照片或票据，再为下次旅行留一句备注。", "每天記下一件小事：你在哪裡、什麼讓你驚喜、當時感覺如何。加一張照片或票據，再為下次旅行留一句備註。", "毎日ひとつ、場所、驚いたこと、気持ちを記録しましょう。写真やチケットを添え、次回のためのメモも。", "매일 장소와 놀라웠던 일, 기분을 기록해 보세요. 사진이나 티켓을 더하고 다음 여행을 위한 메모도 남겨 보세요.", "Anota cada día un momento: dónde estabas, qué te sorprendió y cómo te sentiste. Añade una foto o entrada y una nota para volver.", "Notez chaque jour un instant, une surprise et votre ressenti. Ajoutez une photo ou un billet, puis une note pour votre prochaine visite.", "Halte jeden Tag einen Moment fest: Ort, Überraschung und Gefühl. Ergänze ein Foto oder Ticket und eine Notiz für das nächste Mal.", "Registre um momento por dia: onde estava, o que surpreendeu e como se sentiu. Acrescente uma foto ou ingresso e uma nota para a próxima visita."]),
"Check your passport and entry requirements with official sources, then confirm baggage rules and flight times with your airline. Keep documents, medication and a charger in your carry-on.":row(["Check your passport and entry requirements with official sources, then confirm baggage rules and flight times with your airline. Keep documents, medication and a charger in your carry-on.", "通过官方渠道确认护照与入境要求，再向航司核对行李规定和航班时间。证件、药物和充电器放在随身行李中。", "透過官方管道確認護照與入境要求，再向航空公司核對行李規定和航班時間。證件、藥物和充電器放在隨身行李中。", "パスポートと入国条件は公的情報で確認し、手荷物規定と便の時刻は航空会社に確認。書類、薬、充電器は手荷物に。", "여권과 입국 요건은 공식 자료로, 수하물 규정과 운항 시간은 항공사에서 확인하세요. 서류와 약, 충전기는 기내 가방에 넣으세요.", "Consulta los requisitos de pasaporte y entrada en fuentes oficiales y confirma equipaje y horarios con la aerolínea. Lleva documentos y medicinas contigo.", "Vérifiez passeport et entrée auprès des sources officielles, puis bagages et horaires auprès de la compagnie. Gardez documents et médicaments en cabine.", "Prüfe Pass und Einreise bei offiziellen Stellen, Gepäckregeln und Flugzeiten bei der Airline. Dokumente, Medikamente und Ladegerät gehören ins Handgepäck.", "Confira passaporte e entrada em fontes oficiais e confirme bagagem e horários com a companhia. Leve documentos, remédios e carregador na cabine."]),
"Start with transport and accommodation, then set a daily amount for food and activities. Keep a separate buffer for changes, and note the currency and payment fees.":row(["Start with transport and accommodation, then set a daily amount for food and activities. Keep a separate buffer for changes, and note the currency and payment fees.", "先列交通和住宿，再为餐饮与活动设定每日预算。留一笔应急金，并留意汇率和支付手续费。", "先列交通和住宿，再為餐飲與活動設定每日預算。留一筆應急金，並留意匯率和支付手續費。", "交通と宿泊から見積もり、食事や活動の一日予算を決めましょう。予備費を取り、通貨と決済手数料も確認。", "교통과 숙박을 먼저 정하고 식사와 활동의 하루 예산을 잡으세요. 예비비를 두고 환전 및 결제 수수료를 확인하세요.", "Calcula transporte y alojamiento, luego un importe diario para comidas y actividades. Reserva un margen y revisa cambio y comisiones.", "Estimez transport et logement, puis un budget quotidien pour repas et activités. Gardez une réserve et vérifiez les frais de paiement.", "Plane Transport und Unterkunft, dann einen Tagesbetrag für Essen und Aktivitäten. Halte eine Reserve bereit und beachte Wechsel- und Zahlungsgebühren.", "Comece por transporte e hospedagem, depois defina um valor diário para refeições e atividades. Reserve uma margem e confira taxas de câmbio."]),
"Bring sun protection, a hat, water and a quick-dry layer. Add a small waterproof pouch and check local conditions before swimming.":row(["Bring sun protection, a hat, water and a quick-dry layer. Add a small waterproof pouch and check local conditions before swimming.", "带上防晒用品、帽子、饮用水和速干衣物，再准备一个小防水袋。下水前注意当地海况。", "帶上防曬用品、帽子、飲用水和速乾衣物，再準備小防水袋。下水前留意當地海況。", "日焼け対策、帽子、飲み水、速乾性の服を。小さな防水袋も便利です。泳ぐ前に現地の状況を確認しましょう。", "자외선 차단용품, 모자, 물과 빨리 마르는 옷을 챙기세요. 작은 방수 주머니를 준비하고 수영 전 현지 상황을 확인하세요.", "Lleva protección solar, sombrero, agua y ropa de secado rápido. Añade una bolsa estanca y revisa las condiciones antes de nadar.", "Prenez protection solaire, chapeau, eau et vêtement à séchage rapide. Ajoutez une pochette étanche et vérifiez les conditions avant de nager.", "Nimm Sonnenschutz, Hut, Wasser und schnelltrocknende Kleidung mit. Ein wasserdichter Beutel hilft; prüfe vor dem Schwimmen die Bedingungen.", "Leve proteção solar, chapéu, água e roupa de secagem rápida. Use uma bolsa estanque e confira as condições antes de nadar."]),
"I can help with packing, rain, flights, budgets, beaches and travel journals. Try one of these topics.":row(["I can help with packing, rain, flights, budgets, beaches and travel journals. Try one of these topics.", "我可以帮你整理行李、雨天准备、航班、预算、海边旅行和手账的建议。可以试试这些话题。", "我可以幫你整理行李、雨天準備、航班、預算、海邊旅行和手帳的建議。可以試試這些話題。", "荷造り、雨の日、飛行機、予算、海辺、旅日記についてお手伝いできます。これらの話題を試してみてください。", "짐 꾸리기, 비 오는 날, 비행, 예산, 해변, 여행 일지에 대해 도와드릴 수 있어요. 이 주제 중 하나를 물어보세요.", "Puedo ayudarte con equipaje, lluvia, vuelos, presupuestos, playas y diarios de viaje. Prueba uno de estos temas.", "Je peux vous aider avec les bagages, la pluie, les vols, le budget, la plage et les carnets de voyage. Essayez un de ces sujets.", "Ich helfe dir bei Gepäck, Regen, Flügen, Budget, Strand und Reisetagebuch. Probiere eines dieser Themen.", "Posso ajudar com bagagem, chuva, voos, orçamento, praia e diários de viagem. Experimente um desses temas."]),
]
